{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b7010c97c40512bc54c2018f847818d3b2c90c3163d30efb8d4cc88cd57be95c", "ja": "（映画祭のイメージポスターに、伊織が抜擢された。\n今は衣装の試着中だけど、どうかな？）", "zh": "（伊织被选为电影节宣传海报的主角。\n现在正在试穿服装，感觉怎么样？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "1789b85f005364f1a41445a8c91722a3bdc30bf0b698be8c75dce531e3250031", "ja": "あら、{$P$}。\nちょうど今、着替え終わったところなの。どう？", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。\n我刚好换完衣服呢。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fd960492b67ac1c45e1db187d4927eb877e7a6d13ffe5699221a6e0fe16474b3", "ja": "思った通り、ばっちりだよ。伊織はそういう\nドレス風の衣装だと、いつも以上に品があるよな。", "zh": "果然和我想的一样，完美无缺。伊织穿这种礼服风格的服装时，比平时更显得优雅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "681107bcbd372471ff598b22a05b1b07555e28c89f47547d85d4ca988ff3deae", "ja": "ふふん♪　あんたの見立ても、なかなかじゃない。\n私も、まあまあ、気に入ったわ。", "zh": "哼哼♪你的眼光还挺不错的嘛。\n我也还算喜欢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1004_p", "source_sha256": "04e25943b4f9faaa0ba3f67f6fe47993098f6efe53ad382bc7572e05e3f80e13", "ja": "ポスターの伊織は、映画の案内人ってコンセプトだけど\n……それに相応しい気品というか、知性を感じるよ。", "zh": "海报上的伊织虽然是以电影向导为概念，但……我能感受到与这个概念相称的气质，或者说智慧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "2efce530c92502080979c02e9a9f1a9876fbd050b1067d64c9cbff19aa008f5d", "ja": "当然よ。\n気品も知性も、もとから溢れてるんだもの♪", "zh": "那是当然。\n毕竟我本来就充满气质与知性嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "7eaeae1b28f56ebe06690e3a923e23aea77cb32b79d6fd99fa7cd42aeba03616", "ja": "案内人らしく、映画のこともビシビシ言ってあげるわ。\n最新のヒット作から昔の名作まで、任せなさい♪", "zh": "我会像个向导一样，把电影相关的内容也一一告诉你。\n从最新的热门电影到过去的经典佳作，都交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9fc292a6a5f6df8dc22c8da7891d004a7ed6fcb9186f40f69b946ace72b3374b", "ja": "そ、そうか。案内人らしく、\nなるべくいい所をビシビシ頼むな？", "zh": "这、这样啊。那就像个向导一样，尽量把好的地方狠狠指出来，拜托了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "45d387ab810daf9d607804dc3f78b125ac05e83302f7c83c6550aafe65963512", "ja": "それより……。\nねえ、あんたは大丈夫なの？", "zh": "比起这个……喂，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6e4d3000be9c155ecea7fc520259ffb184016bbd1868fe61069804f6ca10b1d2", "ja": "え？　ああ、映画祭の映画なら、\nまだ全部は見てないけど……。", "zh": "诶？啊，电影节的电影嘛，\n还没全部看完……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "e7d3b12d12295bb2e899a0b2c5045e17ed56a02a8c7fb48aecd72d9e27c91e44", "ja": "違うわよ。そうじゃなくてあんたの、そのシワだらけの\n着たきりスーツ、なんとかならないわけ？", "zh": "不是啦，不是那个意思。我是说，你那身皱巴巴、一直穿着不换的西装，就不能想想办法吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1011_p", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "5415285df92f343b7819acc5c4377a49e14e84837cd12861de25d91f0f87dd4f", "ja": "もうちょっと格好つけなさいよね、見た目くらい。\n兄さんが『男は額縁』って言ってたわよ？", "zh": "至少装得像样点吧，起码外表上是这样。\n我哥哥不是说过“男人就是画框”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "19c473eb27a84ee6d3622f9f35652d654f6921c2883d18973a90d7e15c4eed14", "ja": "もし私がイブニングを着るなら、あんたの衣装は\nタキシードか燕尾服。貧相な額縁じゃ困るんだから。", "zh": "如果我穿晚礼服，你的礼服就得是燕尾服或塔士多。寒酸的画框可不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "0cb029640aa311c499f97ed73c8d7f3d80e1eeae2460ebce244efcc16beba15f", "ja": "せめてネクタイくらい、きちんと締めなさいよね。\nほら、カフスもタイピンの向きも、ちゃんと揃えて。", "zh": "至少领带也给我好好系上。\n还有，袖扣和领带夹的方向也要对齐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1015_p", "source_sha256": "2a0b5d40028ee4d53c52d0a6ad649a70252ba92936616e8154dbe3791649f8a7", "ja": "いや……俺が格好つけても、ステージには\n上がらないし、伊織と並ぶ機会はないだろ？", "zh": "不……就算我打扮得再帅，也没法登上舞台，\n也没有机会和伊织并肩站着吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "b71ebaf9cf12f6e5dbc9141de524949442d6fa0ba76f2f698eade6e86032ecee", "ja": "何言ってんのよ？　あるでしょ！　将来的には！", "zh": "你在说什么呀？当然有机会！将来会有的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5ea3fe2a5297a552393712548fe91e6a2251186a8f80c82c39d54a844224010f", "ja": "将来……？　ど、どんな？", "zh": "将来……？怎、怎样的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "68b0287d58736ee696a8802dcf493460559c1934d821a55949cee96025cfe287", "ja": "私が賞を取って、レッドカーペットを\n歩くときに決まってるじゃない。", "zh": "当然是我获奖、走上红毯的时候啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "d4a79ae04edd6a198277acbf309840a41ed5e8dfdbad11995d5bf89dae91189c", "ja": "いい？　私が歩くときには、あんたが隣に並ぶの。\nそのくらいのこと、わかっておきなさいよね！", "zh": "听好了？我走红毯的时候，你可得并排走在我身旁。\n这种事情，你心里要有数才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_007ior0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_007ior0154_1020_p", "source_sha256": "69d5168cac6aa27ec4333c8422b0a9b760714a711404efc4ec524b25b9c24547", "ja": "（伊織はもう、今回の仕事の先を見ていたらしい……。\nエスコートするために、急いで追いかけないとな！）", "zh": "（伊织似乎已经在考虑这次工作的后续了……得赶紧追上去，好陪她出席才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
